00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:08.000
I see where Joe Staline is trying to find a serum that will make him younger.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:16.000
Well, that's not possible, but if you leave it up to us, we'll see that you don't get any older.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.000
Now I would like to tell you about our American movie.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:24.000
Tonight, this movie, it was not shot underwater. It just looks that way.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:33.000
This picture has murder, robbery, terror, hate, revenge.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.000
It's a story about a boy and his dog.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:45.000
He's the other star's hero, and he plays two parts.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.000
He's a brother and a sister.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.000
Still no good, I tell you.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.000
Hello, are you there? Are you there?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.000
Would you get me Fort Knox, please, in Kentucky, yes.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.000
United States of America. We don't have a Kentucky in England any more.

