Skelton's Film Scrapbook.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:30.000
Pedestrian Polo.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:34.000
Good evening.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:38.000
That's just a straight line. Wait till it goes.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.000
Tonight we're going to have a little educational feature,

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:44.000
and we hope that you'll all be very much interested in.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.000
It has to do with traffic.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.000
Now I'll give you a number to call in just a few minutes.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.000
I can't give you the number now, as I've done this before.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.000
I told you that we'll give you the number during the program, and I will.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:58.000
And as I say, we don't have time to give you the number now.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.000
