Now, look here, Willie. I'm your pal. I don't mind helping you out of these messes.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.000
But I'm an MP.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.000
I know. That means you're my pal.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.000
You keep sticking my neck out.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:45.000
Look, I had to get on K.P. again. They got a new general coming in here, and I don't want to go over that mortar pool and drive around that grass.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.000
Look, I got in trouble with one of them guys, you know.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:53.000
He came up to me, and I didn't salute him. He says, how come you didn't salute me? I said, I didn't know I was supposed to.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:59.000
He says, you see these two stars? Let's go up that main line. He says, you got two boys in your service?

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.000
Where did you go anyway?

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.000
I went on a furlong.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.000
You mean furlong?

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:08.000
No, I went too fur and stayed too long.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.000
There ought to be something eating around here.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.000
There ought to be something around here somewhere.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:19.000
There's a gentleman!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:25.000
That's the colonel?

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:30.000
Why, that poor little fellow, I doubt if he's even weaned yet.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.000
I remember him when he was six foot tall.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.000
What happened to him?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:46.000
Oh, that's a Texan with all the hot air out of him.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.000
Hey, you do me a favor, will you?

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.000
Sure.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:52.000
You get a ride into town any time you want to go into town.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:56.000
You do me a favor. They're going to make me cook for that new general, and will you do me a favor?

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:01.000
Have some of the boys on those details to unload some of that garbage up there, will you?

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:04.000
I will make the finest salad they have ever had.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.000
Okay, I'll take care of it.

