00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.000
Oh, no, no, no, no, no.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.000
I beg your pardon?

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:09.000
Go right ahead, go right ahead.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:13.000
Ah, mighty fine, mighty fine.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.000
Hey, you'll be cooking in the officer's mansion no time at all.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.000
Carry on, old man, carry on, man.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:29.000
Carry on, Willie, carry on, Willie.

