00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:06.000
I just don't know what to cook.

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:10.000
I mean, meat is so high now, I just don't know what to cook.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:14.000
Yes, I know that meat is very expensive, but you see, that's why I'm here.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:18.000
We're going to have a barbeque, sergeant?

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:23.000
I think what would be very good would be to have a large green mixed salad.

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:25.000
A mixed green salad for a thousand men?

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:29.000
Oh, let's not get sick, now.

